{title: Karone Okarone}
{artist: Minar}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G] Karone [D] okarone,        [Em] Nishede ba [Bm] baarone
[C] Tomar namei [G] joto jochna [D] nilam,        [G] Niyome [D] oniyome
[Em] Dohone ba [Bm] dharone,        [C] Amay nikhuj [G] vabo ba pashei [D] chilam
[G] Karone [D] okarone,        [Em] Nishede ba [Bm] baarone
[C] Tomar namei [G] joto jochna [D] nilam,        [G] Niyome [D] oniyome
[Em] Dohone ba [Bm] dharone,        [C] Amay nikhuj [G] vabo ba pashei [D] chilam
[C] Chokhe jol [Em] nona ki,        [G] Niye gelo [D] jonaki
[Am] Keno ami [Em] pothe eka [D] dariye,        [C] Aloder [Em] piyone
[G] Sodium [D] niyone,        [Am] Jeno shobi [G] kothay [D] hariye
Ami [G] tomar didhay baachi,        [Em] Tomar didhay pure [Bm] jaai
[C] Emon didhar [G] prithibite,        [D] Tomay cheyechi [G] purotai
Ami [G] tomar shopne baachi,        [Em] Tomar shopne pure [Bm] jaai
[C] Emon shadher [G] prithibite,        [D] Tomay cheyechi [G] purotai..purotai
[G] Jolete [D] agune,        [Em] Borosha ba [Bm] fagune
[C] Tomar naamei [G] joto megheder [D] gaan,        [G] Jagorone [D] michile
[Em] Kothay je ki [Bm] chile,        [Em] Amay nikhoj bhabo [Bm] niye oviman
